# Generated XLSX exception reports. All 14 are reproducible at any time with
# `make report` from the committed outputs/solution/, so they are not committed
# wholesale. The signature adversarial case is committed as the sample
# submission artifact (see README). Revisit if the brief requires all 14.
# The sample submission artifact lives at
# docs/sample_exception_report_case13.xlsx (committed, obviously named).
reports/

# NOT ignored, deliberately — this is the primary experiment's evidence:
#   outputs/baseline/   real one-prompt control run (frozen; never re-tuned)
#   outputs/solution/   real agent-v1 run
#   results/*.json      scored metrics + comparison, provenance from _meta.json
# The earlier rules here excluded these when they held MockProvider artifacts.
# They now hold the real OpenRouter run (minimax/minimax-m2.7) and are the
# evidence behind every metric in README.md, so they are tracked.
